{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2024-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1706054400, "end_date": 1706745599, "month_true_total": 369, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:52:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "157289800", "author": {"steamid": "76561198172250689", "personaname": "Hans", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198172250689/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 952, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 250, "last_played": 1763263267, "avatar": "451af8be44347c68966b8ce07d45799a7ef4fbea"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun furry shooter game", "timestamp_created": 1706741912, "timestamp_updated": 1706741912, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157283835", "author": {"steamid": "76561199259677384", "personaname": "Shini-Venator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199259677384/", "num_games_owned": 235, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 701, "last_played": 1758420279, "avatar": "815620bf2491be691e9cd2012741e1cba2f0fb06"}, "language": "english", "review": "JUST USE THE MECH MAN", "timestamp_created": 1706734692, "timestamp_updated": 1706734692, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157273483", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018541109", "personaname": "Spiritclaw", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Spiritclaw/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 13146, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1966, "last_played": 1782088813, "avatar": "977e85e11aa14c1449d30909e3e4b43ff116a43b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fun little game, and I enjoy playing it with my friends.  The English language localization could use a little work -- the grammar occasionally has moments where you read a sentence, blink, and realize you have no idea what it's trying to say.  So I'm hoping they'll work on that in an update, but the game is definitely worth playing.", "timestamp_created": 1706723741, "timestamp_updated": 1706723741, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157266320", "author": {"steamid": "76561199117197465", "personaname": "Ollie_Boi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199117197465/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1456, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1444, "last_played": 1711388175, "avatar": "5ae96c76baff5f898a86a1a4d10caf190b16ba18"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game to play with your friends, amazing art style, interesting levels", "timestamp_created": 1706716661, "timestamp_updated": 1706716661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "157241088", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993956729", "personaname": "Supermaths", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993956729/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 5652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5647, "last_played": 1713215884, "avatar": "cabb3b8d25bd2f68b88f1be1a9820db382e8da6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think this game is pretty fun. I tend to like looter shooter games and play them mindlessly for many hours. This game scratches that itch because of the smooth gameplay and multitude of build options. I've only been focusing on a couple heroes but there are a lot of options.\n\nThe gameplay mechanics are straightforward and the character control is smooth. The game also looks pretty good, the art style is nice.  However, I wish some of the drops like coins and essence looked better. I want to be excited about getting coins.\n\nThe only issue I have with the game is that the upgrade options can be wordy and in some cases it's not clear what exactly the effect will be. Sometimes the wording and grammar (in English) are not correct.\n\nI only play single player so maybe multiplayer will be even better.\n\nIf you like looter shooters then check this out.", "timestamp_created": 1706684828, "timestamp_updated": 1706684828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}